      "title": "Claude Second Brain & Folder Workflow: The Complete Guide",
      "preview_text": "Build your AI-native second brain using simple Markdown folders and a CLAUDE.md index file map\n\"Second brain\" sounds a bit pretentious, but at the end of the day, it is just a handful of text files",
      "cover_media": {
        "id": "QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHNlPS+NXgAAKAAIbkB7cExrwAAAA",
        "media_id": "2078779890363498496",
        "media_info": {
